62
00:02:09.728 --> 00:02:12.224
For a big positive z that chance is nearly

63
00:02:12.224 --> 00:02:14.081
one, so GELU passes z through.

64
00:02:14.429 --> 00:02:16.983
For a big negative z it is nearly nought,

65
00:02:16.983 --> 00:02:18.608
so GELU gives nearly nought.

66
00:02:19.082 --> 00:02:19.866
Two worked values.

67
00:02:20.127 --> 00:02:21.913
At one and a half, phi is nought point

68
00:02:21.913 --> 00:02:23.742
nine three three two, so GELU gives one

69
00:02:23.742 --> 00:02:25.484
point three nine nine eight, a little

70
00:02:25.484 --> 00:02:26.703
