71
00:02:26.965 --> 00:02:28.924
At minus nought point seven, phi is nought

72
00:02:28.924 --> 00:02:30.797
point two four two, and GELU gives minus

73
00:02:30.797 --> 00:02:32.757
nought point one six nine four, where ReLU

74
00:02:32.757 --> 00:02:33.323
