78
00:02:37.951 --> 00:02:39.181
Why a smooth version?

79
00:02:39.532 --> 00:02:42.168
ReLU has a sharp corner at nought, and for

80
00:02:42.168 --> 00:02:44.628
every negative input its slope is exactly

81
00:02:44.628 --> 00:02:46.854
nought, so by the chain rule a unit

82
00:02:46.854 --> 00:02:49.197
sitting below nought passes no gradient

83
00:02:49.197 --> 00:02:49.900
back at all.

84
00:02:50.252 --> 00:02:52.478
GELU bends smoothly and keeps a small

85
00:02:52.478 --> 00:02:55.114
slope just below nought, so a unit that is

86
00:02:55.114 --> 00:02:57.105
slightly negative can still learn.

87
00:02:57.457 --> 00:03:00.210
